  characterName: Mysterious Stranger
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueLines:
  - 'Welcome home child. '
  - Few make it this far, fewer still with a heart unbroken
  - 'Three riddles I give you, each a door. '
  - Answer true, and the path ahead will be yours.
  - "Fail, and well\u2026 even the lost have places to be."
